# CRM Sales Process Automation Scope Document

## Executive Summary
This document outlines the scope of the CRM Sales Process Automation project version 1.1 for optimizing sales processes, increasing efficiency, and improving customer relationship management.

## Objectives
- Enhance sales team productivity.
- Streamline the sales pipeline.
- Automate repetitive tasks to allow staff to focus on high-value activities.

## Scope of Work
The project involves:
- Assessment of current sales processes.
- Design and implementation of automated workflows.
- Integration with existing CRM tools.

## Deliverables
1. Documentation of current processes.
2. A fully implemented sales automation tool.
3. Training materials for the sales team.
4. Post-implementation support for three months.

## Technology Stack
- CRM Platform: [Name of CRM]
- Automation Tool: [Name of Automation Tool]
- Additional Technologies: [List any additional required technologies]

## Assumptions
- Stakeholders will be available for regular meetings.
- Current technology infrastructure supports the new automation tools.

## Constraints
- Project must be completed within budget constraints.
- Compliance with data protection regulations is required.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Completion of all deliverables as outlined.
- Positive feedback from the sales team regarding the automation.

